  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;be a local minima of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> is local maximum value of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo></math>"
  },
