  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;be a local minima of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now differentiating the above function we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now equating it to zero we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>24</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;{by checking sign change of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;for maxima}</p><p>Now rewriting&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>33</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
